ns]]\n[[Category:Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{DracoBox}}","text":"*Land Shark is very similar to Thresher in that both are land-based shark Titans and used by Organization members, Captain Caine and Simon Judeau respectively."}],"full_text":"Land Shark is a shark-like Draco-Titan used by Captain Caine.\n\n== History ==\nLand Shark defeated Sabriel in the battle on the cliffs. [The Lost City of Casterwill]\n\n== Abilities ==\nLand Shark is able to surf on ground and is capable of fighting underwater.\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nLand Shark Amulet.png|Land Shark's Amulet\nLand Shark.jpg|Land Shark\n\n==Trivia==\n*Land Shark is very similar to Thresher in that both are land-based shark Titans and used by Organization members, Captain Caine and Simon Judeau respectively.","raw_wikitext":"{{stub}}\n{{Infobox Titan\n| image   = File:Land_Shark.jpg\n| attack  = 5\n| defense = 5\n| type    = [[Draco-Titan]] Warrior {{nosource|?}}\n| size    = Medium {{nosource|?}}\n| ability = Ground Surfing\n| user    = [[Captain Caine]]\n| first   = [[The Lost City of Casterwill]]\n}}\n'''Land Shark''' is a shark-like [[Draco-Titan]] used by [[Captain Caine]].\n\n== History ==\nLand Shark defeated [[Sabriel]] in the battle on the cliffs. {{source|The Lost City of Casterwill}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLand Shark is able to surf on ground and is capable of fighting underwater.\n{{Clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery>\nLand Shark Amulet.png|Land Shark's Amulet\nLand Shark.jpg|Land Shark\n</gallery>\n\n==Trivia==\n*Land Shark is very similar to [[Thresher]] in that both are land-based shark Titans and used by [[the Organization|Organization]] members, [[Captain Caine]] and [[Simon Judeau]] respectively.\n[[Category:Article stubs]]\n[[Category:Draco-Titans]]\n[[Category:Comic Titans]]\n[[Category:Organization Titans]]\n[[Category:Medium Titans]]\n[[Category:Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{DracoBox}}","categories":["Article stubs","Comic Titans","Draco-Titans","Medium Titans","Organization Titans","Titans"],"links":[{